  "prefLabel": "We 101.45 Well log",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 101.45 “Well log” means a written description of the unconsolidated earth materials, rock types, water bearing zones, and depth intervals encountered during the well drilling operation.\n\nSource. #9177, eff 6-13-08 (from We 101.38); renumbered by #12075 (formerly We 101.40)",
